{
  "mn39:0.1": "Majjhima Nikāya 39 ",
  "mn39:0.2": "Mahāassapurasutta ",
  "mn39:1.1": "Evaṁ me sutaṁ—",
  "mn39:1.2": "ekaṁ samayaṁ bhagavā aṅgesu viharati assapuraṁ nāma aṅgānaṁ nigamo. ",
  "mn39:1.3": "Tatra kho bhagavā bhikkhū āmantesi: ",
  "mn39:1.4": "“bhikkhavo”ti. ",
  "mn39:1.5": "“Bhadante”ti te bhikkhū bhagavato paccassosuṁ. ",
  "mn39:1.6": "Bhagavā etadavoca: ",
  "mn39:2.1": "“Samaṇā samaṇāti vo, bhikkhave, jano sañjānāti. ",
  "mn39:2.2": "Tumhe ca pana ‘ke tumhe’ti puṭṭhā samānā ‘samaṇāmhā’ti paṭijānātha; ",
  "mn39:2.3": "tesaṁ vo, bhikkhave, evaṁsamaññānaṁ sataṁ evaṁpaṭiññānaṁ sataṁ ‘ye dhammā samaṇakaraṇā ca brāhmaṇakaraṇā ca te dhamme samādāya vattissāma, evaṁ no ayaṁ amhākaṁ samaññā ca saccā bhavissati paṭiññā ca bhūtā. ",
  "mn39:2.4": "Yesañca mayaṁ cīvarapiṇḍapātasenāsanagilānappaccayabhesajjaparikkhāraṁ paribhuñjāma, tesaṁ te kārā amhesu mahapphalā bhavissanti mahānisaṁsā, amhākañcevāyaṁ pabbajjā avañjhā bhavissati saphalā saudrayā’ti. ",
  "mn39:2.5": "Evañhi vo, bhikkhave, sikkhitabbaṁ. ",
  "mn39:3.1": "Katame ca, bhikkhave, dhammā samaṇakaraṇā ca brāhmaṇakaraṇā ca? ",
  "mn39:3.2": "‘Hirottappena samannāgatā bhavissāmā’ti evañhi vo, bhikkhave, sikkhitabbaṁ. ",
  "mn39:3.3": "Siyā kho pana, bhikkhave, tumhākaṁ evamassa: ",
  "mn39:3.4": "‘hirottappenamha samannāgatā, alamettāvatā k